# Solreign game-mode presets — evil-megacorp HR voice, PG. Keys referenced from
# Resources/Prototypes/_Solreign/GameRules/*.yml gamePreset name/description fields.

solreign-antags-on-spawn-title = Hostile Onboarding
solreign-antags-on-spawn-description = Solreign has streamlined the recruitment pipeline: several of today's new hires were onboarded by a competitor. They know who they are. You do not. Productivity is expected regardless.

solreign-changeling-preset-title = Talent Acquisition
solreign-changeling-preset-description = Solreign's Talent Acquisition division is between headcounts again. A specialist is on-station, off the org chart, building a personnel file one biometric sample at a time. Anyone's face is a vacancy waiting to be filled. Hit your quota.

solreign-compliance-hunt-title = Compliance Hunt
solreign-compliance-hunt-description = A station-wide audit is underway. Vacant positions — pets, machines, the recently reassigned — are being filled at unprecedented speed. Please cooperate with any auditor you may or may not meet.

fleet-operation-night-title = Fleet Operation Night
fleet-operation-night-description = Corporate has authorized simultaneous multi-site operations. Additional Solreign installations are active in this sector tonight; inter-station transit, shared cargo accounting, and cross-site incident response are all considered one shift. Your contract does not specify which station you finish it on.

# Corporate Compliance Sweep station event (game_rules_corporate.yml).
station-event-solreign-corporate-sweep-start-announcement = Attention, asset. A compliance sweep is now in progress. Redundant personnel will be reclassified. Cooperation is noted; the alternative is also noted.
